{"4025180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Portsmoor Abysm", "steam_appid": 4025180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Boulders and Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Catacombs of Portsmoor are dangerous to visit, filled with falling boulders, deadly miasma, ravenous plants, and many other environmental hazards. Every chamber challenges you in new ways, as you strive to open the exit by activating all the stone effigies. <br><br>Do you have what is takes to solve the many puzzles that await you, and survive The Portsmoor Abysm? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Monsters Lurking in the Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of monster lurking in the dark chambers deep below the town. To have any hope of reaching your ultimate goal and escape, you will need to learn how each of them behaves, and how they can be used for your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Catacombs and Save the Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you face down the challenges awaiting you in the depths below Portsmoor, you will uncover the secrets hiding in the catacombs: Who trapped you down here, and why? Who built these halls, and what is the source of the all the other-wordly horrors inhabiting them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Sights and Sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm has hand-crafted pixels with a 16 bit vibe, coupled with atmospheric sounds and music. Escape the stylish catacombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Episodes of Mind-Bending Puzzles, and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm consist of four episode, each with 18 levels of increasingly challenging puzzles. Each chamber is fairly short, and the full first episode can be finished in under an hour, but depending on your skill level the full game will likely provide 6-12+ hours of puzzle solving. Throughout your journey down the Catacombs of Portsmoor is woven a story of ancient mysteries, and trying to get out alive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Boulders and Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Catacombs of Portsmoor are dangerous to visit, filled with falling boulders, deadly miasma, ravenous plants, and many other environmental hazards. Every chamber challenges you in new ways, as you strive to open the exit by activating all the stone effigies. <br><br>Do you have what is takes to solve the many puzzles that await you, and survive The Portsmoor Abysm? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/a2a52a622ebd435e945863f4d5c50770.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Monsters Lurking in the Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of monster lurking in the dark chambers deep below the town. To have any hope of reaching your ultimate goal and escape, you will need to learn how each of them behaves, and how they can be used for your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/b878aa9802efa5e6db39c1d7ab33d35e.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Catacombs and Save the Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you face down the challenges awaiting you in the depths below Portsmoor, you will uncover the secrets hiding in the catacombs: Who trapped you down here, and why? Who built these halls, and what is the source of the all the other-wordly horrors inhabiting them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/e94d46fb84fbe814eb6e2ea675a7d8c4.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Sights and Sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm has hand-crafted pixels with a 16 bit vibe, coupled with atmospheric sounds and music. Escape the stylish catacombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.poster.avif?t=1786729205\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.webm?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025180/extras/71c91713304d61921698d305c50b15f3.mp4?t=1786729205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Episodes of Mind-Bending Puzzles, and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Portsmoor Abysm consist of four episode, each with 18 levels of increasingly challenging puzzles. Each chamber is fairly short, and the full first episode can be finished in under an hour, but depending on your skill level the full game will likely provide 6-12+ hours of puzzle solving. Throughout your journey down the Catacombs of Portsmoor is woven a story of ancient mysteries, and trying to get out alive.</p>", "short_description": "Push boulders, solve Sokoban-style puzzles, avoid deadly traps, face otherworldly monsters, and uncover the ancient horrors hiding in the catacombs. The Portsmoor Abysm is a cute cosmic horror retro puzzle game, inspired by classics such as Boulder Dash, Supaplex, and Emerald Mine.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong><br><str